+/**
+ * Getter for the NV current-value registers (mirror). It exists to check that the
+ * immediate values written with glVertexAttrib*NvNV really reach draw time: in
+ * Timbury the pass that discards bitten fragments (alpha test NOTEQUAL) draws 3 quads
