+/**
+ * MESA_NV_TEXWATCH=<obj_name>[,<obj_name>...]: readback of the level-0 content of the
+ * listed textures at the frame boundary (a safe point: the same readback inside a
+ * draw stalls these applications).  Depth textures are read as depth, cube maps one
+ * face at a time (MESA_NV_TEXWATCH_FACE=0..5).
